<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>As I enjoy the grace of Thy salvation</l><l>And contemplate how Thou Thy Son hast sent,</l><l>Who died that we might be Thy new creation,</l><l>Thy life expressing to the full extent;</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When in the church, in blest participation,</l><l>I see how millions Thine own life possess,</l><l>How they are built to form Thy habitation,</l><l>Containing Thee, Thy fulness to express;</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>As I expect the coming age of fulness</l><l>And hope to share the new Jerusalem,</l><l>With all the heavens and the earth in newness</l><l>And all Thou art expressed in all of them;</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
